<title>JAPAN: FamilyMart -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>FamilyMart -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Reveneu	     56.20		vs	   46.10</p>
<p> Operating	   11.21		vs	    9.33</p>
<p> Current	     11.50		vs	   10.05</p>
<p> Net		    6.02		vs	    5.15</p>
<p> EPS		   70.64 yen	  vs	   67.43 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     87 million	  vs	  79 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 14.00 yen	  vs	   13.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - FamilyMart Co Ltd is a leading convience store chain and a subsidiary of Seiyu Ltd.</p>
